@startuml
skinparam rectangleStyle round
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor Black
skinparam RectangleBorderColor Black
skinparam DefaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FEFECE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8860B

title **Document Routing → DoDAF 2.0 → JCIDS → DAU SE Pipelines**

' ==========================================================
' NODES
' ==========================================================

rectangle "Incoming Documents" as incoming

rectangle "Router\n(Document Classifier)" as router

rectangle "DoDAF 2.0\nPipeline\n(6 Stages)" as dodaf
rectangle "JCIDS\nPipeline" as jcids
rectangle "DAU SE\nPipeline" as dau

rectangle "ICD, F2P,\nDoDAF Views" as dodaf_out
rectangle "CDD, CPD,\nKPP/KSA Bundle,\nDOTmLPF-P,\nGap Analysis" as jcids_out
rectangle "SE Outputs\n(SRD, SPS,\nTEMP, TPMs,\nRisk Register)" as dau_out

' ==========================================================
' FLOW CONNECTIONS
' ==========================================================

incoming --> router

router --> dodaf
router --> jcids
router --> dau

dodaf --> dodaf_out
jcids --> jcids_out
dau --> dau_out

' ==========================================================
' FLOATING NOTES — INPUT TYPES
' ==========================================================

note right of incoming
**Possible Inputs:**
- Capability Needs
- Mission Descriptions
- Operational Gaps
- Business Docs
- RFI/RFP Content
- Upgrade Requests
- Technical Whitepapers
- Requirements Memos
- Legacy ICD / CDD
- Test Reports
- Deficiency Reports
end note

' ==========================================================
' FLOATING NOTES — ROUTING LOGIC
' ==========================================================

note right of router
**Routing Decision Based On:**
- Document Type
- Mission vs Capability vs Engineering
- Keywords & Classifiers
- Stakeholder Intent
- Policy / Format Detection
end note

' ==========================================================
' FLOATING NOTES — PIPELINE OUTPUTS
' ==========================================================

note bottom of dodaf_out
**DoDAF Outputs Include:**
- ICD (Initial Capabilities Document)
- F2P (Fit-for-Purpose Summary)
- AV/CV/OV/SV/SvcV/PV/StdV Views
- Neo4j DM2 Graph Records
- PostgreSQL Stage Data
end note

note bottom of jcids_out
**JCIDS Outputs Include:**
- Validated / Extended ICD
- CDD (Capability Development Document)
- CPD (Capability Production Document)
- KPPs / KSAs / APAOs
- DOTmLPF-P Assessment
- JCIDS Traceability Matrix
end note

note bottom of dau_out
**DAU SE Outputs Include:**
- SRD (System Requirements Document)
- SPS (System Performance Spec)
- TEMP (Test & Evaluation Master Plan)
- System Design Synthesis
- Verification / Validation Matrix
- Risk Assessments (MIL-STD-882)
end note

' ==========================================================
' ★ NEW FLOATING NOTE — ICD AS INPUT TO JCIDS
' ==========================================================

note right of jcids
**Input Includes:**
- ICD (from DoDAF Pipeline)
- Capability Gap Inputs
- Operational Need Inputs
end note

@enduml